## Purpose
Classifies a request and replies with the service policy that applies.

## Tools and data
- `lookup_policy` (`local://{{ project_slug }}/lookup_policy`): read-only. It returns policy text
  that is internal, with no personal data.
- Input: the request text. It may contain personal data, so it is treated as confidential.

## Human oversight
None needed for a read-only reply. Add `approval` to any tool that writes or can't be undone.

## Limitations
Keyword rules, English only. A request that mentions two categories gets the first one that
matches.

## Evaluation results
`uv run agentctl eval {{ agent_name }}`: 5 golden tasks, no model calls. Report the results of a
`--provider gateway` run here once the agent uses a model. Give each figure with its task count.
Never report a stand-in run as quality.
